but it did not make the final shortlist.In March 2014 he signed a letter in support of the position of the President of Russia Vladimir Putin on the situation in Ukraine and Crimea. For this he was banned from entering Ukraine.\n\n", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2022-05-19T12:09:02.223278+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 2502, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karen_Shakhnazarov"}], "uuid": "83929b88-2ac5-4e47-a4db-cbf61afabef9", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "23006", "external_references": [{"id": 10698, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q167113"}, {"id": 10699, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "100451753"}, {"id": 10700, "source": {"name": "LOC Auth", "slug": "loc-auth"}, "source_identifier": "no2001101857"}, {"id": 10701, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-no2001101857"}], "date_modified": "2023-09-13T12:30:47.291380+10:00"}, {"id": 37571, "name": "S&T-Film Berlin", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2070231, "title": "A Little night music", "work_id": 95334, "role": "production company", "role_id": 941, "is_primary": true}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": "", "date_of_death": "", "genders": [], "languages": [], "places_of_operation": [], "biography": "", "biography_author": null, "date_of_biography": "2023-05-09T11:31:07.218616+10:00", "external_links": [], "uuid": "6e4f69c8-f466-4548-b00b-8c777927ee85", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "12198", "external_references": [{"id": 35565, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q121040092"}], "date_modified": "2023-09-06T01:00:28.104760+10:00"}]}